{
    "title": "Fasting App & Calorie Counter",
    "description": "Say bye to exercise and dieting! With intermittent fasting (IF), a weight loss method trusted by hundreds of millions worldwide, this Fasting Tracker will help you hit your goals effortlessly!\r\n\r\nLose weight, get fit and feel great. It guarantees quick and sustainable results, backed by daily fasting plans, diet advice and health insights.\r\n\r\n<b>What is IF? </b>\r\nIntermittent fasting just emphasizes when to eat, so you can still enjoy delicious foods. By reducing frequent eating, calorie intake is decreased, leading to natural weight loss.\r\n\r\n<b> Why IF? </b>\r\nWhen fasting, as your body\u2019s glycogen runs out, it enters ketosis - the body's \"fat-burning\" mode. This state is believed to promote active fat burning, contributing to weight loss and improved overall health.\r\n\r\n<b> Why Us? </b>\r\nFor Everyone\r\n\u00b7 For beginner and experienced fasters, men and women\r\n\u00b7 Step-by-step guide for even novice fasters to get started\r\n\u00b7 Not changing diet, even if you follow a keto or low-cal diet\r\n\r\nPopular Fasting Plans\r\n\u00b7 Hour-based plans, such as 16:8, 14:10, 18:6, 20:4\r\n\u00b7 Day-based plans, such as 18:6, 20:4\r\n\u00b7 Special plans, such as autophagy, OMAD (one meal a day)\r\n\u00b7 Customize your own unique plan\r\n\r\nSmart Calories Counter\r\n\u00b7 Track the calories consumed and burned to get motivation for a calorie deficit\r\n\u00b7 Calculate your daily calories needs\r\n\u00b7 Simply enter the food you eat to get the calorie and nutrition info\r\n\u00b7 Calculate the calories burned for your exercise\r\n\u00b7 Comprehensive calorie analysis\r\n\u00b7 Built-in food barcode scanner\r\n\r\nKnow Your Body\r\n\u00b7 Get insights into the changes in your body while fasting\r\n\u00b7 Daily coaching knowledge & tips about fasting, health, nutrition, weight loss, etc\r\n\r\nEasy Recipes\r\n\u00b7 Easy and delicious recipes\r\n\u00b7 Expert advice for the right foods\r\n\r\nSupportive Tools\r\n\u00b7 Fasting timer: one click to start/end fasting\r\n\u00b7 Fasting tracker: reminders guide you through your plan\r\n\u00b7 Weight tracker: log and track your weight trends\r\n\u00b7 Water tracker: stay hydrated with reminders\r\n\u00b7 Step tracker: motivate you to be more physically active\r\n\u00b7 Food tracker: food diary tracks what you're eating\r\n\u00b7 Fasting tracker and diet app\r\n\r\n<b> Benefits Confirmed by Scientific Studies</b>\r\n\u00b7 The most natural and healthy\r\n\u00b7 Sustainable weight loss\r\n\u00b7 Stabilize blood sugar level\r\n\u00b7 Decrease inflammation and detoxes\r\n\u00b7 Improve overall cellular function\r\n\u00b7 Better brain function and cognitive performance\r\n\u00b7 Lower risk of chronic diseases\r\n\u00b7 Enhance metabolic health\r\n\u00b7 Increase longevity\r\n\u00b7 Look better and feel healthier\r\n\u00b7 No yo-yo effect\r\n\r\nDownload this intermittent fasting app and calorie counter to lose weight naturally without dieting and exercise!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Say bye to exercise and dieting! With intermittent fasting (IF), a weight loss method trusted by hundreds of millions worldwide, this Fasting Tracker will help you hit your goals effortlessly!<br><br>Lose weight, get fit and feel great. It guarantees quick and sustainable results, backed by daily fasting plans, diet advice and health insights.<br><br><b>What is IF? </b><br>Intermittent fasting just emphasizes when to eat, so you can still enjoy delicious foods. By reducing frequent eating, calorie intake is decreased, leading to natural weight loss.<br><br><b> Why IF? </b><br>When fasting, as your body\u2019s glycogen runs out, it enters ketosis - the body&#39;s &quot;fat-burning&quot; mode. This state is believed to promote active fat burning, contributing to weight loss and improved overall health.<br><br><b> Why Us? </b><br>For Everyone<br>\u00b7 For beginner and experienced fasters, men and women<br>\u00b7 Step-by-step guide for even novice fasters to get started<br>\u00b7 Not changing diet, even if you follow a keto or low-cal diet<br><br>Popular Fasting Plans<br>\u00b7 Hour-based plans, such as 16:8, 14:10, 18:6, 20:4<br>\u00b7 Day-based plans, such as 18:6, 20:4<br>\u00b7 Special plans, such as autophagy, OMAD (one meal a day)<br>\u00b7 Customize your own unique plan<br><br>Smart Calories Counter<br>\u00b7 Track the calories consumed and burned to get motivation for a calorie deficit<br>\u00b7 Calculate your daily calories needs<br>\u00b7 Simply enter the food you eat to get the calorie and nutrition info<br>\u00b7 Calculate the calories burned for your exercise<br>\u00b7 Comprehensive calorie analysis<br>\u00b7 Built-in food barcode scanner<br><br>Know Your Body<br>\u00b7 Get insights into the changes in your body while fasting<br>\u00b7 Daily coaching knowledge &amp; tips about fasting, health, nutrition, weight loss, etc<br><br>Easy Recipes<br>\u00b7 Easy and delicious recipes<br>\u00b7 Expert advice for the right foods<br><br>Suppo